Third-party dependencies installed separately (not shipped here)
-----------------------------------------------------------------

Installed by pip from requirements.txt, each under its own license:
FastAPI (MIT), Uvicorn (BSD-3-Clause), PyYAML (MIT), markdown-it-py (MIT),
and their dependencies.

System tools used at run time: GnuPG (archives), OpenSSL (local HTTPS CA),
Docker (through CodeCome), all installed from the operating system.
